        "body": "Total federal obligations for NAICS 541618 are $251M year to date across 658 awards. Average award size is $382K. Obligations fell 70.2% year over year, reflecting a substantial decline from prior fiscal years such as FY25 when obligations were $843M. Contractors should expect a smaller pool of dollars this fiscal year compared with FY24 and FY25."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the major buyers and primes in NAICS 541618?",
        "body": "The Department of Health and Human Services is the largest buyer with $116M, followed by the Department of Defense with $53.9M and the Department of State with $17.9M. NATIONAL COLLEGIATE INVENTORS & INNOVATORS ALLIANCE, INC. is the top vendor with $68M, followed by ISLAND PEER REVIEW ORGANIZATION INC with $52.4M and PALANTIR USG INC with $27.1M. These agencies and vendors account for a sizable share of the $251M obligated this fiscal year."
      }
    ]
